[  541.727235] VBUS on
[  541.749650] VBUS off
[  541.749653] pending state change SNK_READY -> SNK_UNATTACHED @ 650 ms [rev3 NONE_AMS]
[  541.749944] VBUS VSAFE0V
[  541.749945] state change SNK_READY -> SNK_UNATTACHED [rev3 NONE_AMS]
